Package: ClockSHAP
Title: Age-Conditioned SHAP Decompositions for Linear Aging Clocks
Version: 1.0.1
Authors@R:
    person(
        "Payton", "Bock",
        email = "pbock@bu.edu",
        role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: Interpret linear-additive biological aging clocks by decomposing
    the difference between predicted biological age and an age-conditioned
    expected age into exact, per-feature contributions. ClockSHAP provides a
    closed-form SHAP-style decomposition for linear models using a baseline
    feature profile conditioned on chronological age.
